{"sourceUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/75/b2/c12276a226738/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.265645+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/75/b2/c12276a226738/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><a href=\"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/75/b2/c12276a226738/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><span>在《关于中国药科大学</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名的通知》（药大研函〔</span></span><span><span>2025</span><span>〕</span></span><span><span>28</span><span>号）、《中国药科大学国际医药商学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年推免生（含直博生）预选拔工作通知》的有关规定和工作基础上，根据学院第一批次接收推免生预报名和复试情况，现开展第二批次接收推免生预报名及复试工作，有关事项通知如下。</span></span></p><p><span>一、招生专业</span></p><p><span>我院第二批次可接收推免生报名的专业为：</span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong><span>类别</span></strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong><span>研究方向代码</span></strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong><span>研究方向名称</span></strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>硕士学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>制药工程学</span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>硕士专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>制药工程与工艺</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>硕士专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物材料与诊断试剂</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>硕士专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>食品科学与营养工程</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>硕士专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>05</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>绿色制药与健康</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span>二、报名时间及方式</span></p><p><span>系统报名阶段开放时间：</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>日</span><span>-</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><span>报名方式：登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>,</span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></span></p><p><span>学院对申请人资格进行审核，确定入选名单，并于</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>15</span></span><span>日前通知申请人，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。入选同学须于</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>16</span></span><span>日下午</span><span><span>17:00</span><span>前在报名系统中回复确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></span></p><p><span>三、报名条件</span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>.具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>.全国高校</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、基础医学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、食品科学与工程类、数据科学类、人工智能与计算机类、管理学类、经济学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校免试推荐资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>.身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>.学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>.具有良好的英语水平。</span></span></p><p><span>四、报名材料</span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>.身份证或在读学生证（必填）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>.由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>.本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>.外语水平证明，如</span></span><span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>.学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>.获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）。</span></span></p><p><span>五、考核安排</span></p><p><span> 1.复试形式：线上面试。</span></p><p><span><span> </span>2.考核内容及要求：</span></p><p><span> </span><span>⑴学生准备2分钟左右自我介绍（介绍个人情况及本科期间学习及科研经历）</span></p><p><span><span> </span>⑵专家提问，考核内容包括学生专业基础能力、外语能力、综合素质能力等。</span></p><p><span><span> </span>提醒：请考生准备好本人身份证，以备面试时评委老师进行身份查验。</span></p><p><span><strong><span> </span></strong>复试期间，请考生保持手机网络畅通，一直不上线、并联系不上者，视为放弃本次复试。</span></p><p><span><span> </span>3.复试时间</span><span>：9月22日前，学院开展和完成第二批次考核复试，具体安排以学科群里通知为准。</span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span>请通过预报名系统审核，并确认参加面试的同学于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日（周</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>下</span><span><span>午</span><span>1</span></span><span>7</span><span>:00前</span><span>实名</span><span>加入对应学科复试联络群：</span></p><p><span></span></p><p> <div class=\"v10-pdf-pages\"><a href=\"assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-1.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"原文 PDF 第 1 页\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-1.webp\"/></a><a href=\"assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-2.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"原文 PDF 第 2 页\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-2.webp\"/></a></div> </p><p><br/></p><p><span>六、联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>   电话：</span></span><span><span><span>025-86185754</span></span><span><span>；邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span>gxycpu@126.com</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>重点提醒：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span></span>申请我校推荐免试研究生的</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，在全国推免服务系统（预计</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月中下旬）开放后，仍须在该系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎各位同学踊跃报名！</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>中国药科大学工学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"c24af2583a71368ef9d372178c11c92f254020bb61cd8a5f2ba0a8c8aa61412d","textLength":1500,"sourceSha256":"f3874e93ee1646b87711de614f6f8ff844e30770eb68a31114c9d2d2a6518243","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[{"sourceUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/9b/3b/4186834545f1a1268645ad695d75/8a0534cf-d070-40a1-ac21-939d00d22d37.pdf","title":"8a0534cf-d070-40a1-ac21-939d00d22d37","file":"assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b.pdf","sha256":"2622268e0b30c9d3dbe6e71bbbc96173608bbbf0ce53b819698e0768e45dcda9","pages":["assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-1.webp","assets/articles/media/36def5b514019f30b74b-page-2.webp"]}],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d87720fe98a71f7c3b8c","title":"2025年中国药科大学工学院2026年接收推免生第二批次预报名及复试通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.265645+00:00"}
